  "id": "information-technology",
  "term": "information technology",
  "definition": "Information technology refers to digital tools and platforms such as smartphones, virtual reality applications, online learning systems, and laptops used to support learning and skill development. In this context, it is discussed as shaping cognitive abilities like attention, memory, problem solving, and critical thinking, as well as non-cognitive qualities such as perseverance and self-confidence.",
